WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.962
Your report's ready.

00:00:01.962 --> 00:00:06.362
Start with the overview, then open the measurements to see your sample

00:00:06.362 --> 00:00:09.223
values and the reference ranges.

00:00:09.223 --> 00:00:11.130
Take a breath.

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:13.948
These numbers describe a sample.

00:00:13.948 --> 00:00:16.629
They don't decide your future.

00:00:16.629 --> 00:00:21.089
A specialist can help you understand them in the context of your care as a

00:00:21.089 --> 00:00:22.261
couple.

00:00:22.261 --> 00:00:27.321
Jot down your questions, and take the next step when you're ready.

00:00:27.321 --> 00:00:32.224
The measurements and consultations here are simulated.
